flowchart LR
  User --> FE[React + TypeScript + Tailwind]
  FE --> API[FastAPI]
  subgraph Research[AI Research Engine]
    QP[Query Processor] --> RT[Retriever] --> RK[Relevance Ranker] --> CB[Context Builder] --> SY[Ollama Synthesis] --> CV[Citation Validation]
  end
  subgraph Trend[Trend Intelligence Engine]
    PP[Preprocess] --> EM[Sentence Transformers] --> BT[BERTopic] --> TA[Temporal Analysis] --> TS[Trend Score] --> LC[Lifecycle]
  end
  subgraph Ingest[Unified Ingestion]
    COL[Collector] --> NOR[Normalizer] --> DED[Deduplicator]
  end
  subgraph Conn[Connectors]
    GN[Google News RSS]
    YT[YouTube Data API]
    GT[Google Trends]
    RD[Reddit API + OAuth]
  end
  API --> Research
  API --> Trend
  Research --> Ingest
  Ingest --> Conn
  Ingest --> DB[(PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
  Research --> DB
  Trend --> DB
